WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Checked sunset: 18:10. Allow 25 minutes
to compose, 15 to set up, 30 to travel.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Leave at 17:00. Arrive at 17:30.
Be ready at 17:45.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The walk takes another 15 minutes.
Change the travel estimate to 45.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Now leave at 16:45. Arrival and ready
times stay the same.
